# ex05 — target aliases fixture (mirrors demos/1-selection/05-target-aliases.bqn)
# player ships as an alias mask to reproduce the .bqn's mask column verbatim;
# @selected is deliberately non-singleton (2 rows).
n 5
alias cursor 0 0 1 0 0
alias observer 0 1 0 0 0
alias player 1 0 0 0 0
alias selected 0 0 1 1 0
col health num 50 60 70 80 90
col faction sym None Hostile None None None
col gold num 1 2 3 4 5
col damage num 10 20 30 40 50
